					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "SPAN & SHIFT\n\nThe Span node is similar to the Read node in that it reads from a collection.\nBut instead of reading a given index, it reads all values starting from its position up to its size.\nThis can be used to quickly read a subsection of a collection.\n\nThe Shift node moves the entire collection around, wrapping the indices.\n"
					}
				},
